#: src/pages.py:4425
msgid ""
"AnduinOS will use only the selected unallocated space on {disk}. Existing partitions will be preserved.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"AnduinOS 将仅使用 {disk} 上选定的未分配空间。现有分区将保持不变。\n"
"\n"

#: src/pages.py:133
msgid ""
"AnduinOS will use only the selected unallocated space. The installer will "
"not shrink or move an existing filesystem."
msgstr "AnduinOS 将仅使用选定的未分配空间。安装程序不会缩小或移动现有的文件系统。"

